---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { base, site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How the Optsam website handles information: no cookies, no analytics, no stored enquiries. The enquiry form hands off to your own email app or WhatsApp."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Your information,<br /><em>plainly.</em>"
    lede="This is a static information website. It does not have accounts, advertising cookies, analytics or a database of enquiries."
  />

  <section class="privacy section">
    <div class="wrap privacy__grid">
      <aside class="privacy__aside">
        <p class="privacy__updated">Last updated<br /><strong>17 October 2026</strong></p>
        <a class="link-arrow" href={`${base}/contact`}>Contact Optsam <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </aside>

      <div class="prose privacy__body">
        <h2>What this website does not do</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not set advertising or analytics cookies. It does not use
          third-party tracking scripts, social-media embeds, embedded maps or
          embedded videos. It does not create an account for you or store your
          enquiry on a server controlled by this website.
        </p>

        <h2>The enquiry form</h2>
        <p>
          The enquiry form runs in your browser. When you choose “Continue in
          email” or “Continue in WhatsApp”, it prepares a message using the details
          you entered and opens the relevant app on your device. Nothing is
          transmitted by the website itself. You can review the message and decide
          whether to send it.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you send the message, it is delivered through your email provider or
          WhatsApp and received by Optsam at the contact details published on this
          site. Those services handle the message under their own privacy terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Please do not send sensitive medical details</h2>
        <p>
          Use the form to ask about an appointment, services or eyewear — not to
          send medical records, test results or detailed health information. If you
          have an urgent eye problem, go to the nearest hospital or emergency
          service rather than using this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Hosting and technical data</h2>
        <p>
          Like most websites, the hosting provider may process standard technical
          request information (such as an IP address, browser type and the page
          requested) in order to deliver the site and keep it secure. This website
          does not add analytics and does not use that information to profile
          visitors. The final hosting provider’s own privacy notice should be
          checked before launch.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          Links to Google Maps, Instagram, YouTube, the Optsam blog and WhatsApp
          take you to services with their own privacy policies. This website does
          not control those services and does not receive information from them
          unless you choose to interact.
        </p>

        <h2>Photographs of people</h2>
        <p>
          Some photographs on this site show patients, pupils and staff, and were
          published by Optsam on its own blog. The owner should confirm written
          permission and consent before public launch. If you appear in a photograph
          and want it removed, contact Optsam using the details below.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This website is general information, not a service directed at children.
          Please do not submit a child’s personal details through the enquiry form
          without the consent of a parent or guardian.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Because this website does not store enquiries, there is no website record
          to access, correct or delete. If you have sent Optsam an email or WhatsApp
          message and want it corrected or deleted, contact Optsam directly and ask.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Optsam Eye Care and Optical Workshop Store<br />
          {site.address.display}<br />
          Telephone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
          Email: <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a>
        </p>
        <p class="privacy__small">
          This note describes the website as built. It is not a substitute for
          legal advice, and the business owner should review it against the final
          hosting arrangements and applicable Tanzanian data-protection law before
          launch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.3fr) minmax(0, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .privacy__aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    justify-items: start;
    padding-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .privacy__updated {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--quiet);
  }

  .privacy__updated strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .privacy__body {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .privacy__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy__body > h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy__body p {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .privacy__body a {
    color: var(--teal-deep);
  }

  .privacy__small {
    margin-top: 2rem !important;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.72rem !important;
    line-height: 1.65 !important;
    color: var(--quiet) !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .privacy__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .privacy__aside {
      position: static;
      grid-auto-flow: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }
</style>
